 * <p><b>An assertion that says "at least".</b> Each claim below is a count. A design with
 * no mutual exclusion at all reserves twice and writes two Transfers, and every
 * {@code hasSizeGreaterThan} or {@code anySatisfy} written against it passes.
 *
 * <h2>What forces the overlap</h2>
 *
 * <p>Two latches, and only one of them is the one that matters. {@code sendTogether} lines
 * the requests up so that they leave together, which is what makes them concurrent. It is
 * not what makes the outcome deterministic: the window in which the winner's key reads
